# Baxia, Mystic Tortoise

> Baxia is the tank you pick when the enemy draft plans to win by healing through your damage. He is not a blind engage roamer. He is a moving anti-sustain zone that needs terrain, follow-up damage, and a clear target list before the lobby starts.

